OL,3,AUS senators call for investigation into
OL,4,AUkraine's Starlink restrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the letter, sent on Thursday to the
OL,7,FUS Department of Defense inspector
OL,8,Fgeneral, the senators say they have
OL,9,F"grave concern" about reports of speed
OL,10,Frestrictions between 12 and 14 October.
OL,12,FThe White House and Pentagon have not
OL,13,Fresponded to the suggestion the US
OL,14,Fmight have had a role in the alleged
OL,15,Fslowdown.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
